       CBL INITCHECK
      * INITCHECK(LAX), THE DEFAULT SUBOPTION: Y HAS NO VALUE CLAUSE
      * AND NO PATH TO THE IF STATEMENT INITIALIZES IT, SO THE COMPILER
      * WARNS (RETURN CODE 4). THE PROGRAM IS NOT REJECTED.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZE148N.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  Y PIC 9.
       01  Z PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF Y > 5
               MOVE 2 TO Z
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM ZE148N.
